/usr/bin/gbs
gbs 2.0.8
usage: gbs qbbuild [-h] [--url URL] [--conf-path CONF_PATH]
                   [--template TEMPLATE] [--variable VARIABLE]

    Configuration can be set in ~/.gbs.conf:
      [quickbuild]
      url = https://quickbuild.tizen.org
      conf_path = Tizen/GBS/Build
      user = your_username
      passwd = your_password
      build_type = Full
      repo_type = ALL
      build_reference = Live
      build_pkg_list_add = tools/gbs@abc123...

    Examples:
      $ gbs qbbuild
      $ gbs qbbuild --variable build_type=Full
      $ gbs qbbuild --variable build_pkg_list_add="tools/gbs@abc tools/mic@def"
      $ gbs qbbuild --variable build_pkg_list_add="@/path/to/list.txt"
      $ gbs qbbuild --conf-path "Other/Config" --variable build_type=Incremental
      $ gbs tqb
    

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --url URL             QuickBuild server URL (default:
                        https://quickbuild.tizen.org)
  --conf-path CONF_PATH
                        QuickBuild configuration path
  --template TEMPLATE   path to custom XML template file
  --variable VARIABLE   override variable, format: KEY=VALUE (can be specified
                        multiple times). Available variables: build_type
                        (Partial/Full), repo_type (ALL), build_reference (Ref.
                        Snapshot/Live), snapshot_num, build_pkg_list_add (Add
                        Package List), build_pkg_list_modify (Build Package
                        List), build_pkg_list_rm (Remove Package List).
                        Package list values: space separated or @/path/to/file
/usr/bin/build
/usr/share/man/man1/build.1.gz
